    "updated_at": "2023-08-08T04:55:17Z",
    "body": "> Side question: is there a plan to expand the WPT test suite for these pseudos? As I mentioned in [web-platform-tests/interop#304](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/304), the current testing is quite light.\r\n\r\nThere's an initial set of tests getting landed in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/39293\r\n\r\nI'm hoping to write more whenever I have time.\r\n\r\nI'm off next week, but here's what planning to do:\r\n\r\n- [ ] FACE tests\r\n- [ ] `<button>` / `<select>` tests\r\n- [x] Form submission tests (resets the user-interacted state), also test that FormData() does not reset.\r\n- [ ] Potentially port some of these tests: https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/search?q=moz-ui-%28in%29%3Fvalid&path=test&case=false&regexp=true\r\n",
