    "body": "> We received some valuable feedback on the :user-invalid behavior on form submission, I'll be reworking a bit the form submission model.\r\n\r\nChecking in here. While the WPTs look reasonable for the normal use case behavior, the lack of a landed spec makes me a bit nervous about including this in Interop 2023. I previously closed https://github.com/web-platform-tests/interop/issues/304, but I'm wondering if I should re-open it? And we can punt this item until Interop 2024, perhaps?",
