    "updated_at": "2023-08-09T16:50:46Z",
    "body": "> This PR defines FACE or buttons to be equivalent to `:valid` / `:invalid` (although that isn't really what WebKit does atm), but I'm open to feedback for what folks want to do for non-textfield form controls in general.\r\n\r\nI see the FACE point, but aren't all buttons [barred from constraint validation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#barred-from-constraint-validation)?",
